    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DUELANT \u2013 is a dueling simulator from a young indie team GamePunk Studio.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your opponents in adrenaline-pumping duels! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the undefeated champion of all times and settings! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blow your enemy limb from limb! </strong>\ud83e\udd20 /\u0335\u0347\u033f/\u2019\u033f\u2019\u033f \u033f \u033f\u033f \u033f\u033f \u033f\u033f\ud83d\udca5 \ud83e\udd2f </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXCITING BATTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The near future. Duelant simulator will allow any player to immerse himself in the fascinating world of duels, while the risk of dying is reduced to zero. Now it is entertainment and the opportunity to earn money in virtual battles. However, adrenaline and excitement has not canceled. Each opponent is a new challenge. Each arena - unpredictable conditions. Each duel - new rules. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each duelist will be accompanied by the AI-assistant Malena, who will always find the right words to motivate... or simply rejoice at the success of her prot\u00e9g\u00e9... or just be happy for her prot\u00e9g\u00e9's success.. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle in this game is a challenge and a test for the strong of heart. At the same time, the duels themselves are limited by time. Only 30 seconds to find out who is the toughest duelist here. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854500/extras/2865a8a7eb81e4690a432984acc745fb.poster.avif?t=1751100270\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854500/extras/2865a8a7eb81e4690a432984acc745fb.webm?t=1751100270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854500/extras/2865a8a7eb81e4690a432984acc745fb.mp4?t=1751100270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > different weather conditions; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > possibility to buy new types of weapons; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ever-changing dueling rules; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > the AI companion Malena, who accompanies the players, with a distinctly Mrs.; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > leaderboard of top shooters; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > roguelike element in tournament mode, where each new fight carries the potential threat of rolling back all tournament progress to the beginning and forfeiting all money; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > pumping character skills between duels; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ability to change character avatar on defeated Bosses; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > shooting off unnecessary limbs from your opponents. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADD TO YOUR WISH LIST NOW!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854500/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.poster.avif?t=1751100270\" width=605 height=49 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854500/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.webm?t=1751100270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DUELANT \u2013 is a dueling simulator from a young indie team GamePunk Studio.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your opponents in adrenaline-pumping duels! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the undefeated champion of all times and settings! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blow your enemy limb from limb! </strong>\ud83e\udd20 /\u0335\u0347\u033f/\u2019\u033f\u2019\u033f \u033f \u033f\u033f \u033f\u033f \u033f\u033f\ud83d\udca5 \ud83e\udd2f </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXCITING BATTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The near future. Duelant simulator will allow any player to immerse himself in the fascinating world of duels, while the risk of dying is reduced to zero. Now it is entertainment and the opportunity to earn money in virtual battles. However, adrenaline and excitement has not canceled. Each opponent is a new challenge. Each arena - unpredictable conditions. Each duel - new rules. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each duelist will be accompanied by the AI-assistant Malena, who will always find the right words to motivate... or simply rejoice at the success of her prot\u00e9g\u00e9... or just be happy for her prot\u00e9g\u00e9's success.. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle in this game is a challenge and a test for the strong of heart. At the same time, the duels themselves are limited by time. Only 30 seconds to find out who is the toughest duelist here. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854500/extras/2865a8a7eb81e4690a432984acc745fb.poster.avif?t=1751100270\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854500/extras/2865a8a7eb81e4690a432984acc745fb.webm?t=1751100270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854500/extras/2865a8a7eb81e4690a432984acc745fb.mp4?t=1751100270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > different weather conditions; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > possibility to buy new types of weapons; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ever-changing dueling rules; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > the AI companion Malena, who accompanies the players, with a distinctly Mrs.; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > leaderboard of top shooters; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > roguelike element in tournament mode, where each new fight carries the potential threat of rolling back all tournament progress to the beginning and forfeiting all money; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > pumping character skills between duels; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ability to change character avatar on defeated Bosses; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > shooting off unnecessary limbs from your opponents. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADD TO YOUR WISH LIST NOW!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854500/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.poster.avif?t=1751100270\" width=605 height=49 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854500/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.webm?t=1751100270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
